      "art:ordem": 37,
      "art:texto": "Mark Neumann, Daniel King, Iz Beltagy, and Waleed Ammar. 2019. ScispaCy: Fast and robust models for biomedical natural language processing. In Proceedings of the 18th BioNLP Workshop and Shared Task, pages 319-327, Florence, Italy. Association for Computational Linguistics."
    },
